! PRWOL [MW*m#3] Wolfram radiation power
!       POST D.E. JENSEN R.V. e.a., Atomic Data and Nuclear Tables, 
!        Vol.20 (1977) 397.
! (PPPL-1352 1977)
!    (Yushmanov 27-12-89)
! Corrected by Pereverzev 29-07-96
! Usage:  PE=...-PRWOL*NE*NIZ1
T=TE(J)*1000.
Z=      LOG10(TE(J))
  if (T .le. 333.)                Y=1.3
  if (333 .le. T .and. T .le. 3.E3)   Y=1.6-1.32*Z**2
if (T .gt. 3.E3 .and. T .lt. 7.E3)  Y=1.3
if (T .gt. 7.E3 .and. T .lt. 1.5E4) Y=1.3-1.8*(Z-.845)
if (T .gt. 1.5E4)               Y=.7
PRWOL =10.**Y
